        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-325578-325643">同様にもし、（Ｂ）で表わした（Ａ）の価格 p</seg><hi rend="subscript" source="#source-325643-325681"><seg source="#source-325643-325644">a</seg></hi><seg source="#source-325681-325726"> において、この個人が（Ａ）の d</seg><hi rend="subscript" source="#source-325726-325764"><seg source="#source-325726-325727">a</seg></hi><seg source="#source-325764-325790"> 量を需要すれば、p</seg><hi rend="subscript" source="#source-325790-325828"><seg source="#source-325790-325791">a</seg></hi><seg source="#source-325828-325831">, d</seg><hi rend="subscript" source="#source-325831-325869"><seg source="#source-325831-325832">a</seg></hi><seg source="#source-325869-325872">, o</seg><hi rend="subscript" source="#source-325872-325910"><seg source="#source-325872-325873">b</seg></hi><seg source="#source-325910-325931"> の間に方程式</seg></p>
